    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "155(1) When a person is in a position to exercise control of a network"@en;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/realizedBy> <https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2012c00870#sch-1-sec-155-ss-1>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/integrityHash> "99257b827d424080ee26b0e21c4329e07c49336901f01252b17d65260bd6d219";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/values/partOf> <https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-155>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "A person is in a position to exercise control of a telecommunications network if they meet certain conditions.";
